                                                "sense_id": "6d4ed0a4-daac-36ca-852e-31e0e1ff5557",
                                                "text": "'T is written in the Hebrew Chronicle, / How the physicians, leaving pill and potion, / Prescribed, by way of blister, a young belle, / When old King David's blood grew dull in motion, / And that the medicine answered very well […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
